              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MSPREE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added Feta instead of tofu and loved it! I can't wait for my garden to get going and use this all summer! Great recipe to take for family picnics!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michael Spehr"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a simple yet delicious salad. Due to ingredients available in the fridge, I used feta instead of tofu, black beans instead of kidney beans, and cilantro instead of basil. The only mild negative would be that it doesn't need so much dressing, but that is obviously a personal preference and easily correctable.",
            "datePublished": "2017-10-30T15:28:26.953Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Suzytoons"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Took the lazy way out and used a container of grape tomatoes, cut them in half, also used an English cucumber (love the flavor and you don't have to take the seeds out). Did what other people had suggested and used Feta cheese instead of tofu and also used chick peas instead of kidney beans. For dressing used Italian dressing, it was delicious and even better the next day, would definitely make this again...thanks.",
            "datePublished": "2016-06-21T22:21:12.807Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Patsy Leroe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So simple and yet so yummie. My fiance isn't a fan of vegetables, especially tomatoes... \nI made it the night before and let it marinade overnight in the fridge. He took it to work for lunch along with some baked chicken and he absolutely loved it! Said it was like a tease cause he wanted more..lol. Brownie points for me and a healthy choice for him :)",
            "datePublished": "2015-06-20T15:35:18.137Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mitoney"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I added Greek dressing, feta, and kalamata olives to give it a Greek flavor. We had ripe avacado so I threw that in too. Everyone in the family loved it.",
            "datePublished": "2016-09-07T02:26:38.560Z"
          },
          {
