            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LashGal"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I didn't add the tofu but I would have liked that in this salad as well. The only change I made was adding 1/2 cup of kidney beans and didn't add any salt. I used Newman's Own Light Balsamic Vinaigrette for the dressing. Reliable and light recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2010-07-28T18:56:45.817Z"
          },
          {
