              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SAUCIER25"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Super easy to make - I used two cucumbers, four tomatoes, 1/2 red onion and instead of tofu, used herbed feta cheese. Drizzled Newman's Own Balsamic Vinaigrette over the top and tossed. I was unsure about the kidney beans but we tried it and was a hit! Might also try kalamata olives next time for a more Greek-style salad with the feta.",
            "datePublished": "2008-06-15T15:17:42.703Z"
          },
